OL,3,GNorth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FOvercast with outbreaks of
OL,6,Fheavy and persistent rain,
OL,7,Fparticularly across the hills and
OL,8,Fmountains. Risk of some hail and
OL,9,Fthunderstorms first thing. Becoming
OL,10,Fdrier and brighter from the west
OL,11,Fthrough the morning. Temperatures
OL,12,Faround the seasonal average.
OL,13,
OL,14,CTonight:FA dry night to come with
OL,15,Fplenty of clear spells and light
OL,16,Fwinds. Temperatures will drop quickly
OL,17,Fto low single figures in rural and
OL,18,Fsheltered spots. Grass frost likely.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
